# Slice 9 (Layer A density v3) fixture: 25-option-some-unwrap using WHEN.
# The original requires 12 lines for the Match/PCN/PVR/MC tower; WHEN
# expands inline to one line.
# Round-trip: canonical hash equals 25-option-some-unwrap.json's.
@v=1 root=result
someCase SCS "Some" intT
noneCase SCS "None" _
optionT SUM [someCase noneCase]
someValue SV optionT "Some" 42
result WHEN someValue optionT "Some(n) -> n | None -> 0"
